  "courtTiers": {
    "note": [
      "CourtTier (src/types.ts) has six values and courts.go.jp publishes six case",
      "collections — these are two different axes and must not be zipped together.",
      "The collections are two court tiers plus four subject-matter corpora; district,",
      "family and summary court decisions are not separately published, they appear",
      "inside 下級裁判所(速報) and the subject-matter collections.",
      "Only the mappings the live site states are recorded here."
